# Phase-4 replay archive — trade domain: every trader interaction kind in one
# gesture sequence (meet with the reputation modifier chain, purchase, give,
# haggle, threaten, hug, move). Each action is one report; the host executes
# the real TradeStockMachine and broadcasts a full authoritative overwrite,
# and the guest must converge after EVERY step. The delayed-trade sibling
# covers fault injection; this file locks the no-fault sequence.
#
# Fossil of: TradeSimulationTests.FullInteractionSequence_ConvergesAfterEveryStep
# Mechanism: TradeChannel.SendTraderAction -> host TradeStockMachine ->
#            TradeChannel.BroadcastTraderState (full overwrite)

@0 trade g1 meet offset=-5 scale=0.7 post=3
@33 expect trade_received g1 1 within 1000
@33 expect trade_converged g1
@33 trade g1 purchase item=bandage
@66 expect trade_received g1 2 within 1000
@66 expect trade_converged g1
@66 trade g1 give value=20
@99 expect trade_received g1 3 within 1000
@99 expect trade_converged g1
@99 trade g1 haggle
@132 expect trade_received g1 4 within 1000
@132 expect trade_converged g1
@132 trade g1 threaten
@165 expect trade_received g1 5 within 1000
@165 expect trade_converged g1
@165 trade g1 hug
@198 expect trade_received g1 6 within 1000
@198 expect trade_converged g1
@198 trade g1 move
@231 expect trade_received g1 7 within 1000
@231 expect trade_converged g1
